  "finding": "Nine remaining delegated legacy Chain Material callers now record proper completion on actual successful Fusion summon event via a temporary continuous observer reset after the callback. Thirty-six scoped original-effect/current-installed-metadata cases pass: successful Fusion/revival; material-dependent failed summon/illegal revival exclusion; successful summon with immediate recipient departure/proper revival; observer cleanup against later intentionally uncompleted unrelated Fusion. Old source permits18 actual illegal revivals. Omitted completion/disabled restriction controls fail18each; location-only/retained-observer faults9each. All11 source-scan delegated callers now have scoped legacy contract repairs, including prior Heat/Sear.",
  "qualification": "Full bundled legacy Chain Material39980304 activation/selection/banishment/callback and full original source operations. Neutral trap metadata/recipient/materials/restriction/probe. Plate/Roar actual GY banish costs; Moon actual GY banishment trigger; Sanctuary seeded Field with actual other-effect Insect Special Summon trigger; Metal/Planktonites field-seeded, Planktonites actual required self-material; Aqua/Grimoire standard Spell activation; Sphinx Hand reveal/ignition. Existing explicit IsFaceupEx/empty mandatory-material mappings and Planktonites exactly-one forced-group-to-card mapping remain qualified. Original source recipes/mandatory-material/recipient/helper-version/native Omega/other printed clauses remain open. Different fixed-script SpecialSummonStep contract not substituted. Direct normal branches preserved.",
  "primary_rule": "https://www.yugioh-card.com/en/downloads/rulebook/SD_RuleBook_EN_10.pdf#page=15",
  "remaining": "Scarecrow218261525 Link/Windborne Eye256110263 Synchro unchecked direct returns still require reachable native failure proof; original helper/version/runtime qualifications and full printed-clause coverage remain open.",
